### Variaveis
@URL_API = http://localhost:3000

### GET na raiz da API
GET {{URL_API}}

### POST no produto
POST {{URL_API}}/produto
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome":"Aderbal",
  "preco":123,
  "qtd": 12
}
### POST no usuarios
POST {{URL_API}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome":"Aderbal",
  "email":"email@if.com",
  "senha": "123123"
}

### POST no login
POST {{URL_API}}/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":"email@if.com",
  "senha": "123123"
}